    <bib:Article rdf:about="https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/american-political-science-review/article/longterm-effects-of-neighborhood-disadvantage-on-voting-behavior-the-moving-to-opportunity-experiment/4896C6743CF5D53DDD067D51D93A8CA7">
